# Session 8: the second container process of the RGB feasibility run duplicates the canonical
# frames bit for bit (compare_container_two_processes.json); only its records are committed.
logs/session8/rgb_feasibility/container_run2/frames/
logs/session8/rgb_feasibility/container_run2/*.mp4
# The canonical RGB feasibility clips (aligned frames + ground-truth actions, ~350 KB) are evidence.
!reports/session8/rgb_feasibility/linux-aarch64-container-1f685638f28c/*.mp4

